    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Garden Story Known Only to &quot;Me&quot; and &quot;Him&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a visual novel where you progress through the story by deciphering language, similar to solving a puzzle. The protagonist, &quot;Me,&quot; will spend 90 days living with &quot;Him,&quot; a beastman in a cage. His words are in an unknown language, but you can decipher them based on his reactions and context. By connecting with him, the hidden truth may be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/a77f42e51bc94b90f324e4d5839fc9a7.poster.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/a77f42e51bc94b90f324e4d5839fc9a7.webm?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/a77f42e51bc94b90f324e4d5839fc9a7.mp4?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War between humans and the beastmen tribes living on the frontier is imminent. The beastmen tribes are said to be extremely violent and unable to communicate. &quot;Me,&quot; a linguist who wants to stop the war for a certain reason, proposed to the country to research the beastmen's language and negotiate with them. One day, &quot;Him,&quot; a beastman imprisoned in a cage as a research sample, is sent to &quot;Me.&quot; The 90-day story of &quot;Me&quot; and &quot;Him&quot; begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/b8efb88a009b8b43c39e53f614747e01.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become &quot;Me,&quot; a linguist, and decipher the words of &quot;Him,&quot; the beastman. The given time limit is 90 days. As you increase the number of words you understand through over 100 topics, special events will occur, deepening your relationship with &quot;Him.&quot; Furthermore, you will approach the truth hidden behind the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/df03ddbcab44fcd61159ea0168e994b1.poster.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/df03ddbcab44fcd61159ea0168e994b1.webm?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/df03ddbcab44fcd61159ea0168e994b1.mp4?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Inspiration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a word that you cannot understand no matter what, use &quot;Inspiration.&quot; By doing so, &quot;Me&quot; can flash on the correct answer to the word. Inspiration recovers over time and through events. Please use it strategically. (Inspiration may not be available depending on the difficulty level.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dictionary:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words that have been successfully deciphered are recorded in the dictionary. Please use it when you want to look back on the deciphered words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/5f3a278a9ce832604ad7d6d6c64ab1d0.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Multiple Endings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 8 endings that &quot;Me&quot; and &quot;Him&quot; will reach. What path will the two take beyond the barriers of words and race?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/bd0ecbcde654937c6825fce81eb24f51.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Garden Story Known Only to &quot;Me&quot; and &quot;Him&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a visual novel where you progress through the story by deciphering language, similar to solving a puzzle. The protagonist, &quot;Me,&quot; will spend 90 days living with &quot;Him,&quot; a beastman in a cage. His words are in an unknown language, but you can decipher them based on his reactions and context. By connecting with him, the hidden truth may be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/a77f42e51bc94b90f324e4d5839fc9a7.poster.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/a77f42e51bc94b90f324e4d5839fc9a7.webm?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/a77f42e51bc94b90f324e4d5839fc9a7.mp4?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War between humans and the beastmen tribes living on the frontier is imminent. The beastmen tribes are said to be extremely violent and unable to communicate. &quot;Me,&quot; a linguist who wants to stop the war for a certain reason, proposed to the country to research the beastmen's language and negotiate with them. One day, &quot;Him,&quot; a beastman imprisoned in a cage as a research sample, is sent to &quot;Me.&quot; The 90-day story of &quot;Me&quot; and &quot;Him&quot; begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/b8efb88a009b8b43c39e53f614747e01.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become &quot;Me,&quot; a linguist, and decipher the words of &quot;Him,&quot; the beastman. The given time limit is 90 days. As you increase the number of words you understand through over 100 topics, special events will occur, deepening your relationship with &quot;Him.&quot; Furthermore, you will approach the truth hidden behind the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/df03ddbcab44fcd61159ea0168e994b1.poster.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/df03ddbcab44fcd61159ea0168e994b1.webm?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/df03ddbcab44fcd61159ea0168e994b1.mp4?t=1750991092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Inspiration:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a word that you cannot understand no matter what, use &quot;Inspiration.&quot; By doing so, &quot;Me&quot; can flash on the correct answer to the word. Inspiration recovers over time and through events. Please use it strategically. (Inspiration may not be available depending on the difficulty level.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dictionary:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words that have been successfully deciphered are recorded in the dictionary. Please use it when you want to look back on the deciphered words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/5f3a278a9ce832604ad7d6d6c64ab1d0.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Multiple Endings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 8 endings that &quot;Me&quot; and &quot;Him&quot; will reach. What path will the two take beyond the barriers of words and race?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559170/extras/bd0ecbcde654937c6825fce81eb24f51.avif?t=1750991092\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p>",
